ttps://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-210x118/12/77/58/df.jpg"},{"height":75,"width":75,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-75x75/12/77/58/df.jpg"}]},{"imageSource":"PROFESSIONAL","caption":"","isCover":false,"variants":[{"height":100,"width":100,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-100x100/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":200,"width":200,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-200x200/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":400,"width":400,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-400x400/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":240,"width":360,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-360x240/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":320,"width":480,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-480x320/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":360,"width":540,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-540x360/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":446,"width":674,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-674x446/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":480,"width":720,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-720x480/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":118,"width":210,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-210x118/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"},{"height":75,"width":75,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-75x75/0a/69/47/ea.jpg"}]}],"logistics":{"start":[{"location":{"ref":"LOC-o0AXGEKPN4wJ9sIG0RAn5JHVMRExEOzXZF36Tb77fDXHyFrupPxj/IR9aixoS1xd"},"description":"The official departure point for all tours departing from Zurich is Sihlquai Bus Station, near Zurich\u2019s main train station (Z\u00fcrich HB). Please check in at least 15 minutes before departure at the \u201cBest of Switzerland Tours\u201d counter with your QR code on your voucher ready, printed or electronically."}],"end":[{"location":{"ref":"LOC-o0AXGEKPN4wJ9sIG0RAn5JHVMRExEOzXZF36Tb77fDXHyFrupPxj/IR9aixoS1xd"},"description":"The official departure point for all tours departing from Zurich is Sihlquai Bus Station, near Zurich\u2019s main train station (Z\u00fcrich HB). Please check in at least 15 minutes before departure at the \u201cBest of Switzerland Tours\u201d counter with your QR code on your voucher ready, printed or electronically."}],"redemption":{"redemptionType":"NONE","specialInstructions":"We kindly request that you arrive at least 15 minutes prior to departure and check in at the ticket counter marked with ''Best of Switzerland Tours''. Please have your confirmation details and proof of identification (ID) ready. You may present your tour voucher either as a printed copy or electronically on your smartphone or tablet. \n\nIf you are unfamiliar with the location, we recommend allowing extra time for your journey. Should you have any difficulty finding your way, please contact us as early as possible at +41 (0)44 710 50 50. Our team is available to assist you daily from 7:00 to 21:00."},"travelerPickup":{"pickupOptionType":"MEET_EVERYONE_AT_START_POINT","allowCustomTravelerPickup":false}},"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich","description":"Witness breathtaking snowy mountain landscapes on this day trip from Zurich to Mount Titlis. First, your guide points out some top Lucerne attractions on a short orientation drive through the city, followed by some free time in this charming city. Then, continue to Engelberg in the Swiss Alps and ride in a revolving cable car to the top of mighty Mount Titlis for majestic views of ice boulders and crevasses. Get closer to the crevasses on the Ice Flyer chairlift, enjoy some snow tubing at the Glacier Park and walk across Europe\u2019s highest suspension bridge for more spectacular views.\n\nOptional (in winter, for ski beginners only): Choose the Snow Experience option. Slide down the hill on snow tubes and try skiing once in a lifetime on the beginner slopes \u2013 definitely a memorable experience you shouldn't miss. A Titlis Snow Park staff member (English-speaking) will provide the equipment and supervise the activities.","inclusions":[{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Ice Flyer (weather permitting; only with the \u201cMt Titlis Day Tour\u201d option)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Fully guided tour by a professional multilingual guide (English/Spanish)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Aerial cable cars to Titlis summit incl. \"Rotair\" (revolving) or \"Titlis Connect\" (non-revolving)(*)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Snowtubing (weather permitting: May-Oct at Mt Titlis | Dec-Mar at middle station Tr\u00fcbsee)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Cliff Walk and Glacier Cave (weather & snow permitting)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Transportation in a comfortable air-conditioned coach"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Carbon-balanced operations certified by myclimate"}],"exclusions":[{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Hotel pick-up drop-off"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Food and drinks (available for purchase in Lucerne or at the summit of Mount Titlis)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Winter clothing"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Gratuities"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Personal expenses"}],"additionalInfo":[{"type":"STROLLER_ACCESSIBLE","description":"Infants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller"},{"type":"PUBLIC_TRANSPORTATION_NEARBY","description":"Public transportation options are available nearby"},{"type":"INFANT_SEATS_AVAILABLE","description":"Specialized infant seats are available"},{"type":"NO_HEART_PROBLEMS","description":"Not recommended for travelers with poor cardiovascular health"},{"type":"PHYSICAL_MEDIUM","description":"Travelers should have at least a moderate level of physical fitness"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Tour operates in all weather conditions, please bring a warm jacket, shoes with a solid rubber sole and sun glasses to experience all indoor and outdoor attractions"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Ski Experience option: min. age 10 years; children must be accompanied by an adult"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Ski Experience option: designed for ski first-timers only (no access to other slopes, no experience required, no skiing lesson)"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Ski Experience option: subject to weather conditions; if cancelled a partial refund will be provided"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Ski Experience option: Ice Flyer not included"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"**From June 2026: Due to the construction of the new Titlis tower and mountain station, visits to the summit will be limited to approximately one hour to enjoy the available activities (weather permitting) before descending to the Tr\u00fcbsee middle station, where restaurant facilities will be available.**"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Optional visit of observation deck \u201cTITLIS Horizon\u201d (available from June 1st, 2026). Cost: CHF 18.00 adult / CHF 9.00 child (to be paid on spot in cash or by credit card)"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"(*) The TITLIS Rotair will be closed from 17 August to 11 December 2026. Outside of this period, routes and modes of transportation may be subject to change without prior notice due to ongoing construction work"},{"type":"HEALTH_OTHER","description":"The Ski Experience option is not recommended for travelers with back problems or pregnant travelers"}],"cancellationPolicy":{"type":"STANDARD","description":"For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours before the scheduled departure time.","cancelIfBadWeather":false,"cancelIfInsufficientTravelers":false,"refundEligibility":[{"dayRangeMin":1,"percentageRefundable":100},{"dayRangeMin":0,"dayRangeMax":1,"percentageRefundable":0}]},"bookingConfirmationSettings":{"bookingCutoffType":"START_TIME","bookingCutoffInMinutes":720,"confirmationType":"INSTANT_THEN_MANUAL","manualConfirmationPeriod":1440},"bookingRequirements":{"minTravelersPerBooking":1,"maxTravelersPerBooking":9,"requiresAdultForBooking":true},"languageGuides":[{"type":"GUIDE","language":"en","legacyGuide":"en/SERVICE_GUIDE"},{"type":"GUIDE","language":"es","legacyGuide":"es/SERVICE_GUIDE"}],"bookingQuestions":["SPECIAL_REQUIREMENTS"],"tags":[11903,21708,11928,20250,11938,367653,367654,11889,11930,367661,21972,367652],"destinations":[{"ref":"577","primary":true}],"itinerary":{"itineraryType":"STANDARD","skipTheLine":false,"privateTour":false,"maxTravelersInSharedTour":48,"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":600},"itineraryItems":[{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMZneRzk8aRvZkBhRy3ZR/I="}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"From the centrally located Sihlquai Bus Station, the scenic coach journey begins through the city of Zurich, the beautiful views of the countryside, and along the shores of the Lake of the Four Cantons to Lucerne."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyABDT8/QR98FSVKq1PhyXSg="},"attractionId":12629},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":60},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Enjoy a brief orientation drive, where your guide points out the main attractions of this charming town like the Chapel Bridge, the Town Hall, the Jesuit Church, and the Culture and Convention Centre (KKL). Enjoy some time at leisure to explore the Old Town before the journey continues to Engelberg, where the valley station of Mt. Titlis cable car is located."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyC/AWxqYsk9UtZDWINRQHfQ="},"attractionId":121},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":60},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"YES","description":"At the valley station the breathtaking journey with the different aerial cable cars to the top of Mt. Titlis, located on 3'000 m.a.s.l., begins. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car Rotair. At the top of Mt. Titlis a high alpine panorama awaits you."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyH0HImTyG2EMcC44qU/ZXq4="},"attractionId":24360},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":120},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"YES","description":"Visit the Glacier Cave and pass over Europe's highest suspension bridge - the Cliff Walk! Take a ride with the Ice Flyer which brings you close to the crevasses and the Glacier Park where you can experience snow tubing even in summer! Enjoy magnificent views of the Alps from the restaurants or the sun terrace."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMZneRzk8aRvZkBhRy3ZR/I="}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Your action-packed day trip to Mt Titlis concludes with drop-off at Sihlquai Coach Terminal in central Zurich at approximately 7pm."}]},"productOptions":[{"productOptionCode":"MTTITLIS","description":"Mt Titlis Day Tour from Zurich WITHOUT the beg